Decide how/if to distribute SSL CA certs with components. [INLINE_CODE] runs within kubernetes inside a container. It [needs access to CA certificates to work](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/27684). At the moment, we are grabbing those certs [from the node filesystem](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/27802).

Do we wish to package this some other way? If so, do we have a standard way of doing this? Depending on what we choose, we may be on the hook for keeping this package up to date in the case that there's a security update.

